    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.ai\n\n### Description\n\nI would like to see an option for mini.ai, which disables all warnings when no textobject was found.\r\n\r\nProblem:\r\nWhen the neovim window is smaller than the warning message, it requires user input to go away.\r\n\r\nThanks for this very good module collection.",
