    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> When the neovim window is smaller than the warning message, it requires user input to go away.\r\n\r\nI plan in the near future to update all such messages to respect window width and not cause hit-enter-prompt (i.e. not require user input to go away). It will truncate message. Will this solve your problem?",
