        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@jooooscha, would you mind testing the latest `main` and tell if it is fixed for you? It should not cause hit-enter-prompt now with positive `cmdheight`. With `cmdheight=0` it still has problems but it is due to how zero command height implemented right now.\r\n\r\nI don't think I'll add an option to remove it specifically, though (for reasons in previous comment). Maybe someday with centralized `verbose` option. That will be tracked in #146.",
